[{"id":3001,"name":"城市管理的学问","level":0,"simpleDesc":"","desc":"大人，城市是我们发展的根本。城市等级提升，会带来非常多的好处。不同的属性增强效果、每日自动增长的城市金库（你可以随时提取）、还有更多丰厚奖励的日常任务。城市提升，主要是需要繁荣度。而完成各种任务，都会提升繁荣度。使用城市功能则会削减繁荣度、和军力值。","setting":35,"mapId":2800,"npcId":100,"radarMapID":0,"dialogNotStartNotReady":"","dialogStartNotFinish":"","dialogStartFinish":"而城市的等级和强弱，也会直接影响你所属国家组织的实力。主线任务也会随着你城市等级的提升而触发。随着你选择的路向不同，城市可能会发生各种变化。","exp":0,"money2":0,"money3":0,"acceptCondition":[{"type":31,"typeName":"CONDITION_CITY_ISMASTER","not":0,"rawHex":""}],"type":0,"series":"","acceptMapId":2800,"acceptNpcId":1,"canAccept":1,"_isHelp":false,"wireBase64":"","sources":[{"seq":826,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"34863f485781cd0710b360deafe4864dece2939c1e334aa6740d9bf406acdf11","blob":"blobs/34/34863f485781cd0710b360deafe4864dece2939c1e334aa6740d9bf406acdf11.bin","npcId":2,"mapId":3090},{"capture":"2026-09-20T01-15-00-654Z_dc48ca","seq":11697,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"74a30dfeb6cea687a5cbdd6a5451726d0a4e74a536f2a8b16f016083e1944569","blob":"blobs/74/74a30dfeb6cea687a5cbdd6a5451726d0a4e74a536f2a8b16f016083e1944569.bin","npcId":2,"mapId":1000},{"capture":"2026-09-20T01-15-00-654Z_dc48ca","seq":12485,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"74a30dfeb6cea687a5cbdd6a5451726d0a4e74a536f2a8b16f016083e1944569","blob":"blobs/74/74a30dfeb6cea687a5cbdd6a5451726d0a4e74a536f2a8b16f016083e1944569.bin","npcId":2,"mapId":1000},{"capture":"2026-09-19T23-46-03-133Z_d6e6ad","seq":826,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"34863f485781cd0710b360deafe4864dece2939c1e334aa6740d9bf406acdf11","blob":"blobs/34/34863f485781cd0710b360deafe4864dece2939c1e334aa6740d9bf406acdf11.bin","npcId":2,"mapId":3090},{"capture":"2026-09-21T01-33-38-380Z_0dc594","seq":4531,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"34863f485781cd0710b360deafe4864dece2939c1e334aa6740d9bf406acdf11","blob":"blobs/34/34863f485781cd0710b360deafe4864dece2939c1e334aa6740d9bf406acdf11.bin","npcId":2,"mapId":3090}]}]